  "content": {
    "title": "吉林省大学生就业创业协会工作部署会议在吉林外国语大学召开",
    "source": "吉林省大学生就业协会",
    "publishDate": "2023-05-30",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 5月30日，吉林省大学生就业创业协会工作部署</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">会议</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">在吉林外国语大学国际交流中心召开，吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心主任唐洪丰，吉林省大学生就业创业协会会长李雁冰，副会长刘瑛、金洪培、潘正岩、李东玲、王菲菲、宋春辉、高勇、苗晶及省内有关高校就业工作负责人出席会议，会议由吉林省大学生就业创业协会秘书长范志辉主持。</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"400\" src=\"migration-resource://65a21be2d0427e100ba82e0d2ddcfe1525351e18715066c435b075a466dc3853\" width=\"600\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 会上，李雁冰</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">就</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">组织实施高校毕业生就业创业促进行动</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">提升就业指导服务质量，开展</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">就业创业教育指导教师培训</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">设立大学生就业创业专项研究课题，</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">开展大学生就业创业工作成果评优</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">等八个方面，对协会</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">2023年度工作做出了</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">具体</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">安排部署。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"425\" src=\"migration-resource://1218a7232c71979a6ca1329ed77cde927cee269015bed1f74e262611b6221cf4\" width=\"600\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 对做好协会下一步工作，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">李雁冰提出</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">三点意见</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">：</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">一是重谋划，精确把握协会工作思路。二是强服务，充分发挥协会助力作用。三是抓建设，全面促进协会自身发展。他强调，大学生就业工作事关全局，责任重大，任务艰巨，使命光荣。希望协会各理事单位和各位会长以奋发有为的精神状态、只争朝夕的拼搏精神、求真务实的工作作风，能够有</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“新担当、新突破、新作为”，为提升全省大学生就业创业整体水平，促进我省高校毕业生更高质量、更加充分就业做出更大贡献</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 与会副会长们围绕协会</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">2023年度重点工作及就业工作进行了深度交流，并对协会的定位、功能、发展规划提出建设性意见和建议。秘书长</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">对</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">秘书处近期工作情况及下一步工作计划</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">作了汇报</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">。吉林外国语大学副书记苗晶分享交流</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">学校</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">在</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">毕业生</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">岗位资源开发，就业信息平台建设，职业生涯指导等方面的典型做法及</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">所取得的</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">成效。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 会议结束后，与会成员参观了吉林外国语大学地球村。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n                    ",
    "externalUrl": null
  },
